    "title": "Skull Butterfly [v1.5.1]",
    "description": "[h1][b]Featured Songs[/b][/h1]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]Damned (BO2)[/b] [i]- by Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Lullaby for a Dead Man[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]The One[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Beauty of Annihilation[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]115[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Won't Back Down[/b] [i]- by Eminem, P!nk[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Abracadavre[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Not Ready to Die[/b] [i]- by Avenged Sevenfold[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Pareidolia[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Coming Home[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Nightmare[/b] [i]- by Avenged Sevenfold[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Carrion[/b] [i]- by Clark S. Nova, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]We All Fall Down[/b] [i]- by Clark S. Nova, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Where are We Going[/b] [i]- by Malukah, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Always Running[/b] [i]- by Malukah, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Archangel[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Malukah, Clark S. Nova, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Shepherd of Fire[/b] [i]- by Avenged Sevenfold[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Cold Hard Cash[/b] [i]- by Antonia Bennett, Jack Wall[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Snakeskin Boots[/b] [i]- by Rick Riso, Jack Wall[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Beauty of Annihilation (BO3 Remix)[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Brian Tuey[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Dead Again[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Dead Flowers[/b] [i]- by Malukah, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Dead Ended[/b] [i]- by Clark S. Nova, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]The Gift[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Remember Forever (Extended)[/b] [i]- by Tori Letzler, Jack Wall[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Drowning[/b] [i]- by Malukah, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Mad Hatter[/b] [i]- by Avenged Sevenfold[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Shockwave[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Where are We Going (BO4)[/b] [i]- by Malukah, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Mystery[/b] [i]- by Elena Siegman, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Alone[/b] [i]- by Clark S. Nova, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Lost[/b] [i]- by Julie Nathanson, Craig Houston, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Can You Hear Me? Come In[/b] [i]- by Megan Rice, Mëttle, Malukah, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Destroy Something Beautiful[/b] [i]- by Cristina Scabbia, Kevin Sherwood[/i]\r\n[*] [b]Slave[/b] [i]- by Vicky Psarakis, Sicksense, Kevin Sherwood[/i][/list]\r\n\r\n\r\n[h1][b]Changelog[/b][/h1]\r\n[list][b][v1.5.1][/b][/list]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]Added Songs:[/b] \"Can You Hear Me? Come In\", \"Destroy Something Beautiful\", \"Slave\".\r\n[*] [b]Slight UI Redesign:[/b] And yet again, the settings menu has been cleaned up for a more organized and intuitive experience.\r\n[*] [b]Bugfixes and other minor adjustments[/b][/list]\r\n\r\n[list][b][v1.5][/b][/list]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]Player Button Memory:[/b] The Player Button now retains its position after changing or restarting the wallpaper, based on where it was last dragged.\r\n[*] [b]Parallax Effect V2:[/b] Introduced a new version of the Parallax effect. This new version is now the default option.\r\n[*] [b]External Media Cover Effects:[/b] Added options to adjust the chromatic aberration and VHS effects on the external media cover.\r\n[*] [b]Config Visuals:[/b] Enhanced the visuals of the configuration menu for a better user experience.\r\n[*] [b]Miscellaneous:[/b] Plus, a few other minor adjustments here and there that aren't major enough to detail but still contribute to a smoother experience. (ツ)[/list]\r\n\r\n[list][b][v1.4][/b][/list]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]New Effects:[/b] Introduced Bloom and Butterfly Movement effects to enhance visual dynamics.\r\n[*] [b]Parallax Adjustment:[/b] Added the ability to customize Parallax values for more personalized depth effects.\r\n[*] [b]Particle Color Customization:[/b] Users can now adjust the color of particles to better match their preferences.[/list]\r\n\r\n[list][b][v1.3.1][/b][/list]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]Media Cover Bug Fix:[/b] Resolved an issue where the media cover would not hide when the media was stopped but not fully closed.\r\n[*] [b]Checkbox Functionality Fix:[/b] Fixed a bug that prevented the checkbox for hiding the media cover from working correctly.[/list]\r\n\r\n[list][b][v1.3][/b][/list]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]New Audio Responsive Effects:[/b] Added Chromatic Aberration, Visualizer Bars, and an audio-responsive Player Button color for dynamic audio interaction.\r\n[*] [b]External Media Cover:[/b] Introduced a new, audio-responsive External Media Cover option.\r\n[*] [b]Tips & Tricks:[/b] Added an option to display helpful Tips & Tricks.\r\n[*] [b]Removed Songs:[/b] Undone, Dead Again (Theatrical Mix), The Gift (Theatrical Mix), Stormbound, I Am the Well.\r\n[*] [b]Optimization:[/b] Reduced the quality of songs from 320kbps to 160kbps. The main image has been recoded from .png to .jpg, reducing the overall size of the wallpaper from over 450 MB to approximately 170 MB.[/list]\r\n\r\n[list][b][v1.2][/b][/list]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]Player Button Position Lock:[/b] Added the ability to lock the player button's position. Now, when the location is locked, the position will be remembered even after restarting or changing the wallpaper.[/list]\r\n\r\n[list][b][v1.1][/b][/list]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] [b]Breathing Animation:[/b] Introduced a new breathing animation for a more lifelike appearance.\r\n[*] [b]Music Player Button:[/b] Added a draggable music player button for easier control and customization.\r\n[*] [b]Hair Animation Update:[/b] Updated the hair animation for smoother and more realistic movement.\r\n[*] [b]Parallax Adjustments:[/b] Fine-tuned the parallax values for enhanced depth effects.\r\n[*] [b]Config Options Redesign:[/b] Completely redone the configuration options for better usability and a cleaner interface.[/list]\r\n\r\n\r\n[h1][b]Keyword[/b][/h1]\r\n4k, call of duty, zombies, audio responsive, visualizer, fantasy, rock, music.\r\n\r\n\r\n[h1][b]Download Image[/b][/h1]\r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/xMYmzA7Q#wKEpJVuACHDWBE2Z_gLISQAzPJCFdytD0-mkxcmIzSI",
